  "instructions": [
    "Combine lemongrass stalks, yuzu zest, and green tea in the donabe vessel.",
    "Add halal-friendly milk and bring to a simmer over low heat.",
    "Reduce heat and let steep for 5 minutes.",
    "Strain the tea into a separate container and discard solids.",
    "Add honey to taste and stir to combine.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with sliced lemon and mint leaves.",
    "Place the donabe vessel over a heat diffuser to prevent hotspots and scorching."
